       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-EXPLORE-HIST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EXPLORE-HIST-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MULTI-FORK-TREE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CHECKPOINT-CAPTURE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NON-DESTRUCT-ROLLBACK-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRAJECTORY-MERGE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EXPLORE-HIST-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-EXPLORE-HIST-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-HIST-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-HIST-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TREE-AND-CAPTURE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ROLLBACK-AND-MERGE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-HIST-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TREE-AND-CAPTURE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MULTI-FORK-TREE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHECKPOINT-CAPTURE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ROLLBACK-AND-MERGE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NON-DESTRUCT-ROLLBACK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRAJECTORY-MERGE-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-HIST-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MULTI-FORK-TREE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CHECKPOINT-CAPTURE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NON-DESTRUCT-ROLLBACK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TRAJECTORY-MERGE-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-EXPLORE-HIST-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-HIST-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-HIST-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-HIST-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-HIST-CODE.
